c++, c++26 reflection: std::meta::substitute.

Requires gcc 16.1 to compile.

Enable it:

[~-freflection]

gcc 16.1 is ahead of visual c++ and clang for supporting and compiling c++ reflection code.

[role drop_menu
> [link cpp-stdm-subs-exa Start][br]
